OL,3,GNEWSAParents urged to help children get
OL,4,A'school ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents are being asked to help get
OL,7,Ftheir children ready for school next
OL,8,Fyear so they can manage everyday tasks
OL,9,Fsuch as using cutlery and going to the
OL,10,Ftoilet.
OL,12,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said
OL,13,Fonly 71% of children who started school
OL,14,Fin the county in September had a "good"
OL,15,Flevel of development.
OL,17,FThe government wants 75% of children to
OL,18,Fbe at that level nationally by 2028.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
