OL,3,GNEWSAParents urged to help children get
OL,4,A'school ready'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Victoria Aitken, cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for children, families and
OL,8,Feducation, said: "We know that all
OL,9,Fchildren develop at their own pace and
OL,10,Fsome will need more help than others.
OL,11,FWe want families to know what school
OL,12,Fready means and how they can support
OL,13,Ftheir child's journey to Reception to
OL,14,Fbe as positive as possible."
